flowchart LR
  subgraph Chrome[Window chrome]
    HoverIcon[Hover Slate icon] --> Portal[File / View / Preferences]
    ClickIcon[Click Slate icon] --> PinPortal[Pin portal open]
    GearClick[Readout gear] --> GearMenu[Metrics / Link health]
    F1[F1 or Ctrl+Shift+P] --> AdvWin[Advanced window]
  end
  subgraph Dock[Dock]
    ClickSquircle[Click palette] --> Volatile[Volatile flyout]
    DblClick[Double-click palette] --> Pinned[Pinned flyout]
    HoverDot[Hover dots] --> DotChip[Minimize / layout / Advanced / Drop]
    AdvDot[Advanced dot] --> Catalog[Fullscreen catalog]
    LingerCard[Linger or right-click card] --> CardActs[Add / Remove / Copy / Duplicate / Use]
  end
  subgraph Canvas[Canvas]
    RClickNode[Right-click node] --> ObjMenu[Board object menu]
    RClickEmpty[Right-click empty] --> HiddenMenu[Show hidden / Unlock]
    RClickThumb[Right-click Grid/Venn] --> FileMenu[File tags + place]
    OneFrame[One selected frame] --> FrameTools[Title / order / tags / present]
  end
